# Sailor Design System

Source of truth: `src/styles/designSystem.ts`  
CSS variables are mirrored in `src/components/GlobalStyle.tsx`.

## Colors

### Neutrals
- `--color-black` / `--color-black-deep` — page background
- `--color-white` — primary text
- `--color-muted` — secondary text
- `--color-glass` / `--color-glass-strong` / `--color-glass-border` — glass surfaces

### Brand (use these instead of inventing new hues)
- **主色 `--color-primary` `#2f6bff`** — 鮮豔藍；**克制使用**，目前主要給 footer 中間個人中心按鈕
- 其餘 UI 預設白／玻璃中性色，不要到處鋪主色
- `--color-accent` `#ff8c42` — 輔助，少用
- `--color-secondary` `#946eff` — 輔助，少用
- `--color-success` `#6cc762` — 成功 / LINE 相關
- `--color-danger` `#ff453a` — 錯誤、危險操作
- `--color-warning` `#f5c542` — 警告

Soft variants: `--color-primary-soft`, `--color-accent-soft`, `--color-secondary-soft`.

Do not flood the UI with primary. Keep most text/icons white; reserve primary for key CTAs.

## Usage

Prefer CSS variables in styled-components:

```tsx
color: var(--color-primary);
background: var(--color-accent-soft);
border: 1px solid var(--color-glass-border);
```

Or import tokens:

```ts
import { colors } from '../styles/designSystem'
```

## Style rules
- Dark glass UI: translucent cards + `backdrop-filter`, not flat solid gray cards
- Keep layout as-is when only changing style
- Do not introduce random purples/pinks outside the tokens above
